          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Lost in the Dark"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, darkness, enchantment, mental)\n\n60 feet. An ocluai's presence distorts nearby creatures' senses of direction. Nonmagical bright light within the aura becomes dim light, and nonmagical dim light with the aura becomes darkness. Any non-gorga within range of the ocluai's aura that attempts to move must declare where they intend to move. Before moving, however, the creature must attempt a secret DC 20 Will saving throw. An ocluai can exempt specific creatures from this effect. Magical light anywhere within the ocluai's aura increases the light level as normal and reduces the Will save DC by 5.\n\nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
            },
